{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NuScthKHVf1792986367.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有市場人士指，外圍議息及企業公布業績均可能左右大市，預期本周港股將繼續反覆。</p><p></p><p>獨立股評人熊麗萍表示︰「綜合這麼多因素下，反而投資者可能較觀望。上周因很多負面因素一次過發酵，所以市況基本上直線向下，但本周我相信有些消息大家也不敢看得太淡。我預期本周市況反而較反覆波動，在區間內上落，暫時方向不足，關鍵位置始終要看今年低位、22,500點能否守住。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:23.743570+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:38.566791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:38.566791+00:00","content_hash":"b45837935747bd24aadf5154445b879877f66e7b85e5fefc0f2f3ed982671150","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}